_Akagami/works/45", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2023272, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7f25386/uploads/origins/de333650-05c5-423e-b135-4434cc6d5dc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1bd3a4663756cd9b9b7a26337f1f35c", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7f25386/uploads/origins/de333650-05c5-423e-b135-4434cc6d5dc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7fd36b4e274c39f2305755c0c4bafccb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！私のキャラクター、ミントにお願いがあります。彼女は驚いた表情で氷の中に固まっていることでしょう。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1yui6AuVCqfEXCUga2BidrahUulZlR8w7/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@feat_Akagami/works/44", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2023272, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2bd61556/uploads/origins/de685502-eefa-4369-9b8f-bd49cd932ccd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e023e1ab5832548cc2f5c1540be7e5a0", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2bd61556/uploads/origins/de685502-eefa-4369-9b8f-bd49cd932ccd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1af2c400c02db89647db1dd9501da109", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nパンドラちゃんがKUROMARUによってふたなり状態でチンポロックされ、\n射精したいのにできなくて悶えているイラストをお願いします！", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@feat_Akagami/works/43", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creato